    "id": "19 hari libur nasional dan 10 hari cuti bersama. Mencakup 17 hari dalam SKB, perubahan nama hari raya Kristen, serta libur Pemilu 14 Februari dan Pilkada 27 November berdasarkan Keppres. Cuti bersama mengikuti ketentuan instansi atau perusahaan.",
    "en": "19 national holidays and 10 collective leave days. Includes the 17 days in the joint decree, revised Christian holiday names, and election holidays on 14 February and 27 November set by presidential decrees. Collective leave follows employer or agency rules."
